who test out all the new potato chip flavors wear.

174
00:08:14,580 --> 00:08:15,580
起司汉堡味品客薯片
Cheeseburger Pringles?

175
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:16,580
要了
Yes.

176
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,040
姑娘们
Hey, girls!

177
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,480
看看我的婴儿板
Look at my baby board!

178
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:26,200
我觉得我们终于接近
I feel like we're finally getting close

179
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:27,680
我能一试的阶段了
to something I can work with.

180
00:08:28,140 --> 00:08:29,560
我的灵感在去掉
You know, it really started to flow

181
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:32,060
安·海瑟薇的额头后 就源源而来
once I threw away the Anne Hathaway forehead.

182
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:37,560
这是我见过最吓人的东西了
That is the scariest thing I've ever seen.

183
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:39,680
那你应该庆幸你没看到
Oh, well, good thing you didn't see it

184
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:40,980
有安·海瑟薇额头的版本
with the Hathaway forehead.

185
00:08:43,420 --> 00:08:46,560
我喜欢二号宝宝的样子
I love baby number two, but I don't know.

186
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:48,580
可是奥列格还是想有个惊喜
Oleg still wants to be surprised.

187
00:08:48,940 --> 00:08:50,720
你何不给我们大家一个美妙的惊喜
Why don't you give us all a nice surprise

188
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,240
去趁他睡着的时候帮他刷个牙呢
and brush his teeth while he's sleeping?

189
00:08:54,940 --> 00:08:55,500
是吧
Right?

190
00:08:57,298 --> 00:08:58,960
来 给你
Oh, right. Here.

191
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:01,120
麦克斯 奥列格不能去看球赛
Max, Oleg can't go to the game.

192
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:04,360
我们的门诊预约改到了明天
Our baby appointment got changed to tomorrow,

193
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:06,820
我们还得继续弄小孩身子的部分
and we got to get working on the baby body.

194
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,280
对了
Oh, you know what?

195
00:09:09,540 --> 00:09:11,100
这让我想到
That reminds me.

196
00:09:11,220 --> 00:09:13,140
能给我一张你巨乳的照片吗
Max, do you have a picture of your boobs?

197
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:15,661
算了 不用
Oh, you know what?

198
00:09:15,661 --> 00:09:17,802
我跟奥列格要就行了
I'll get it from Oleg.

199
00:09:20,660 --> 00:09:22,640
真不敢相信我有两张票
I can't believe I have two tickets!

200
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,440
我要打给厄尔
Ooh, I'm gonna call Earl.

201
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:25,860
跟朋友去看球一定很有意思
It'd be fun to go with a friend.

202
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:30,040
你问问我要不要去是会死吗
Would it hurt you to ask me to go to the game?

203
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,800
你明知道我不会答应
You know I'm not gonna say yes.

204
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,240
你想跟我一起去看球赛吗
Do you want to go to the game?

205
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:33,760
好
Yes!

206
00:09:36,060 --> 00:09:37,880
我自己都觉得好惊喜呢
Wow, that surprised me too.

207
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:41,000
这可是真正球员给的贵宾席票
These are VIP tickets from an actual player.

208
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:42,780
这可能会比美食节还赞
This could be better than Bushwick.

209
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:45,320
很多明星都会去看球赛
I mean, lots of celebrities go to those games.

210
00:09:45,647 --> 00:09:46,980
传单呢
Ooh! Where are the fliers?

211
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:48,620
我打赌我们能在那里拉到不少生意
I bet we could get a lot of business there.

212
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:49,640
不许
No!

213
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,880
不许去那边做生意
We are not doing business!

214
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:53,140
今晚是去好好玩的
Tonight is supposed to be fun.

215
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:56,240
我觉得生意很好玩啊 但行吧
Well, I find business fun, but okay.

216
00:09:58,860 --> 00:10:01,100
总有一天 你会欣赏我的干劲
One day, you will appreciate my ambition.

217
00:10:01,100 --> 00:10:03,200
总有天我还会试试吃生菜呢
And one day, I will try lettuce,

218
00:10:03,220 --> 00:10:04,240
但不是今晚
but not tonight.

219
00:10:05,288 --> 00:10:06,543
不带传单
No fliers.

220
00:10:06,856 --> 00:10:07,905
不带传单
No fliers.

221
00:10:07,905 --> 00:10:09,440
不带传单
No fliers.

222
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:11,580
我只是觉得这样错失了良机
I just think this is a missed opportunity.

223
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,120
"错失良机"
"Missed Opportunity"

224
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:15,020
是我当年当钢管舞女郎的艺名
was my stripper name at the Salty Dog.

225
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:19,540
我今晚就是不想工作
Look, I don't want to work tonight.

226
00:10:19,540 --> 00:10:21,460
这句话也是我当年的招牌语
Which also happened to be my catchphrase.

227
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:35,120
这不可能是贵宾席
These can't be VIP seats.

228
00:10:35,740 --> 00:10:37,920
姐好久没有这么上气不接下气了
I haven't been this winded since I climbed

229
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:39,820
上一次是在夏令营为了爬上上层社会
the social ladder at theater camp.

230
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:42,020
这位置多好呀
These seats are great!

231
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,841
我通常都是坐在停车场
I usually sit in the parking lot

232
00:10:43,841 --> 00:10:46,805
围着烧垃圾的火 唱着杜沃普摇滚乐
around a trash fire, singing doo-wop.

233
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:50,340
我从来没有坐过最后一排
It's just, I've never sat in the last row before.

234
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:53,120
我爸总是确保让我坐上第一排
My father made sure I was always in the front.

235
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,720
百老汇看剧 时装周看秀
Broadway, fashion week,

236
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:56,000
以及他的庭审
his criminal trial.

237
00:10:56,860 --> 00:10:58,680
我爸也曾让我坐过第一排
My father got me front-row seats

238
00:10:59,020 --> 00:11:00,440
观看他得"爱无能"奖
to the "Inability to Love" awards.

239
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:03,840
我会试着不念叨这事 但我想说
I'll try and let this go, but I'm just saying,

240
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,580
我们本可以去参加美食节
we could have gone to the Taste of Bushwick,

241
00:11:05,580 --> 00:11:07,420
从那里 也比这里离球场近
and we'd still be closer to the court.

242
00:11:07,740 --> 00:11:10,460
我超爱布希维克美食节
Oh, I love the taste of Bushwick.

243
00:11:11,500 --> 00:11:13,480
我不太喜欢
I don't care for it much.

244
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:17,380
我是琼 这位是戴安
Hi, I'm June, and this is Dianne.

245
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:20,877
我们有点像末排之"后"
We're sort of the "Mayors" of section Y.

246
00:11:20,877 --> 00:11:22,678
每场比赛必到
Been to every game.

247
00:11:23,380 --> 00:11:24,400
我是麦克斯 这位是卡洛琳
I'm Max. This is Caroline.

248
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,220
你们要"来根手指"吗
You guys want a finger?

249
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:28,620
我们只是朋友啦
Oh, we're just friends.

250
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:31,420
你们要不要这根手指
Do you want a finger?

251
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:32,960
好啊
Sure.

252
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,500
如果你们有多的 我们就要
We'll take one if you got an extra.

253
00:11:35,060 --> 00:11:36,140
那热狗怎么样
And how 'bout that hot dog?

254
00:11:36,280 --> 00:11:37,100
你还吃吗
You still working on that?

255
00:11:38,700 --> 00:11:40,820
麦克斯 你又不知道这根手指放过哪里
Max, you don't know where that finger has been.

256
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,540
这话什么意思
What do you mean?

257
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:46,500
它之前放在我车里的一个箱子里
It's been in a box in my car.

258
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:48,980
是啊 卡洛琳
Yeah, Caroline.

259
00:11:49,380 --> 00:11:51,060
这根手指放进过她的箱子[阴部]
This finger's been in her box

260
00:11:51,300 --> 00:11:51,960
就从车里拿出来了
out in the car.

261
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,080
你是哪部分听不懂啊
What part of that don't you get?

262
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:55,800
小心
Careful.

263
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:58,980
这杯啤酒花的钱 比我去年买内衣裤花的钱都多
That beer cost more than I spent on underwear last year.

264
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:03,220
我不喜欢坐这么靠上
I don't like it up here.

265
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,600
我甚至不喜欢啤酒
I don't even like beer.

266
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:06,580
容易胀气
It's so bloaty.

267
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,500
拜托 没那么糟啦
Come on. It's not that bad.

268
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:10,900
是咩
Oh, really?

269
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:12,700
那为什么那家伙在刮胡子
Then why is that guy shaving?

270
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:17,260
人家肯定是有一个非常重要的面试
Well, obviously, he's got a very important job interview

271
00:12:17,260 --> 00:12:18,940
应征疯狂列车的列车长
as conductor of the crazy train.

272
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:22,460
麦克斯 我们的位置就像在贫民区
Max, our seats are in a shanty town.

273
00:12:22,460 --> 00:12:24,360
刚爬楼梯的时候
I think somebody tried to sell me a hubcap

274
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,380
有人还想卖我轮毂盖
on the way up the stairs.

275
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:27,200
卖你多少钱啊
Ooh! How much?

276
00:12:28,380 --> 00:12:29,940
我能借下你的望远镜吗
Can I borrow those binoculars,

277
00:12:29,940 --> 00:12:31,900
好让我不用看眼前这些烦心事
so I can look at something that's not this?

278
00:12:34,040 --> 00:12:35,340
麦克斯 天啊
Max! Oh, my God!

279
00:12:35,340 --> 00:12:37,460
瞧瞧下面的贵宾席的人
Look at all the VIPs down there.

280
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:39,920
有人也在那边撒"贵宾尿"呢
Well, someone's "VI-peeing" right over there.

281
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:42,220
麦克斯 我想下去
Max, I want to be down there.

282
00:12:42,380 --> 00:12:43,480
我知道你需要什么
Oh, I know what you need.

283
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,938
想要来一发"手指"吗
Wanna finger?

284
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:46,580
瞧
Look!

285
00:12:46,580 --> 00:12:49,000
一对有钱情侣在球场边吵架
A rich couple fighting courtside!

286
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:50,840
那男的气冲冲地走了
Oh, he's storming off!

287
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,440
那女的也气冲冲地走了
She's storming off!

288
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:53,960
你应该在"老娘不在乎"台
You should do play-by-play

289
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,300
做实况报道主播
on the "I Don't Care" Network.

290
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,140
走 我们去偷坐他们的位置
Come on! Let's go steal their seats.

291
00:12:58,520 --> 00:12:58,900
什么
What?

292
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:00,260
我喜欢现在的位置
I like where I am.

293
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:01,460
我的耳膜已经外凸了
My ears already popped.

294
00:13:01,620 --> 00:13:02,340
凑合坐这里算了
We're settled here.

295
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:04,860
这就是咱俩不一样的地方 麦克斯
That's the difference between us, Max.

296
00:13:04,920 --> 00:13:05,740
我不会"凑合"
I don't settle...

297
00:13:05,740 --> 00:13:06,940
除非等我42岁了
until I'm, like, 42,

298
00:13:06,940 --> 00:13:08,820
我可能会嫁给一个比我矮的人
and then I might have to marry someone shorter than me.

299
00:13:09,460 --> 00:13:11,540
相反的是 我喜欢凑合
I, on the other hand, love settling.

300
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:14,240
我小时候的第一句话是 "还凑合啦"
My first words were, "Eh, it's fine."

301
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,520
我们只需进行
Look, all we have to do

302
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:18,360
聪明的战略性转移
is make a few smart, strategic moves,

303
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,940
就有更好的机会在等着我们
and a better opportunity awaits.

304
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:20,680
拜托啦
Please?

305
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:23,020
好啦 抱歉 女士们
All right. Sorry, ladies.

306
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:24,460
她想让我跟她一起"下去"
She wants me to go down with her.

307
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:26,540
告诉她你今天头疼不就好啦
Just tell her you got a headache.

308
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:36,560
要表现得我们本来就是坐贵宾席的主儿
Okay, just act like we belong in the VIP section.

309
00:13:37,400 --> 00:13:40,960
真不敢相信那个加长豪车司机居然拐错弯
I can't believe the limo driver took that wrong turn,

310
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:42,520
所以我们来晚了
and that's why we're late to the game,

311
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:44,280
所以 也晚到了座位
and thus, our seats.

312
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:48,080
你忘了提我们坐"所以"公车来的
You forgot to mention that we took thus bus here.

313
00:13:49,940 --> 00:13:51,680
重点是 我们做到了
The point is, we made it.

314
00:13:51,680 --> 00:13:53,160
我回到了属于我的地方
I am back where I belong.

315
00:13:53,300 --> 00:13:55,520
你能闻到下面的这股铜臭味吗
Can you just smell the money down here?

316
00:13:55,780 --> 00:13:57,600
我觉得那是戈塔克蛋蛋的汗臭味
I think that's Gortak's ball sweat.

317
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:02,100
两位女士
Hello, ladies

318
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:04,560
你们居然在比赛第二节才神奇出现
who magically appeared in the second quarter.

319
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:06,820
我能看看你们的票吗
Can I see your tickets?

320
00:14:10,780 --> 00:14:11,360
干嘛
What?

321
00:14:11,940 --> 00:14:14,080
我去大部分地方 都是凭胸进场的啊
These are my tickets to most places.

322
00:14:14,940 --> 00:14:16,520
我们的票吗 当然可以
Our tickets? Of course.

323
00:14:16,520 --> 00:14:18,000
我先找找包里有没有
Let me just find them in here.

324
00:14:19,940 --> 00:14:20,620
在这里
Here they are!

325
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:22,420
抱歉上面粘了爆米花
Oh, sorry about the popcorn.

326
00:14:22,740 --> 00:14:23,620
我习惯了
I'm used to it.

327
00:14:23,740 --> 00:14:25,160
有钱人都是猪
You rich people are pigs.

328
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:35,140
麦克斯 我五年没被人叫过有钱猪了
Max, I haven't been called a rich pig in five years!

329
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,700
这里真是太酷了
This is pretty cool!

330
00:14:41,980 --> 00:14:43,660
我之前跟楼上那个装了一背包
I told that Chinese lady up top

331
00:14:43,660 --> 00:14:45,300
散卖胡萝卜的中国女人说
with the backpack full of loose carrots

332
00:14:45,300 --> 00:14:47,360
我会回去 但现在我不会
I'd be back, but I don't think so.

333
00:14:48,460 --> 00:14:49,480
老天
Oh, my God.

334
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:51,300
我真应该用潜望镜直播
I should totally Periscope this

335
00:14:51,300 --> 00:14:52,740
好让别人以为我们是大牌
so people think we're big shots.

336
00:14:53,220 --> 00:14:55,320
我们离得好近
We are so close,

337
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:57,820
感觉鼻子随时会被球砸破
I could get my nose broken by a ball!

338
00:14:58,460 --> 00:15:02,160
那我就可以认识帮你修好破鼻子的整容医生
And I could meet the doctor who fixes your broken nose!

339
00:15:03,740 --> 00:15:05,540
一切都那么水到渠成
Everything is working out!

340
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,420
额滴神啊
Oh, my God.

341
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:11,450
我们居然跟杰斯和碧昂斯同一排
We are in the same row as Jay-Z and Beyonce!

342
00:15:12,100 --> 00:15:14,040
他们还把女儿布露·艾薇带来了
And they brought Blue Ivy!

343
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:16,570
真不敢相信我居然看见我们的音乐王室了
I can't believe I'm seeing our royal family!

344
00:15:18,400 --> 00:15:21,140
我也不敢相信我的脚居然能碰到球场
I can't believe I'm touching the court with my feet!

345
00:15:22,180 --> 00:15:24,580
或许我该像狗一样 屁股坐地拖着过场
Maybe I should just drag my butt across it like a dog.

346
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:25,240
会不会太过分
Is that too far?

347
00:15:25,900 --> 00:15:26,940
额滴天神啊
Oh, my God!

348
00:15:27,040 --> 00:15:29,400
碧昂斯刚才居然跟我四目相对
Beyonce just made eye contact with me!

349
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:31,280
她每次都能看到我 只要
She sees me every time she looks

350
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:32,480
往左看[边] 往左看[边]
to the left, to the left.

351
00:15:33,100 --> 00:15:34,520
我应该给他们我们的传单
I should get them one of our fliers.

352
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:37,600
幸好 我总备有一张应急
Luckily, I always keep an emergency flier.

353
00:15:38,420 --> 00:15:39,600
还备了我旧家的钥匙
That and a key to my old house,

354
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:41,140
以防最后发现这只是一场梦
in case this all turns out to be a dream.

355
00:15:42,220 --> 00:15:43,620
我也希望你这恶梦会走
That's my dream too.

356
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:47,660
保姆来了
Ooh! Here comes the nanny.

357
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,360
法兰·卓雪也来了吗
Fran Drescher's here?

358
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:54,680
不 是他们女儿的保姆
No, Blue Ivy's nanny.

359
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:55,920
我把传单给她
I'll get her our flier.

360
00:15:56,303 --> 00:15:59,460
不好意思 穿吊裆运动裤的小姐
Excuse me, miss, in the drop-crotch sweatpants!

361
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:00,952
冲冲冲 还有10秒
Go, go, go! Ten seconds!

362
00:16:00,952 --> 00:16:01,820
等等 小姐留步
Wait! Miss, wait!

363
00:16:01,820 --> 00:16:02,779
能收下这个吗
Can you take this?

364
00:16:02,779 --> 00:16:04,240
-麦克斯 她收下... -冲冲冲
- Max, she took the-- - Go, go, go!

365
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:13,120
麦克斯 你做了什么
Max, what did you do?

366
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:16,000
我像个白痴一样 把你带来看篮球赛
I took you to a basketball game like an idiot!

367
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:19,600
现在我要跑路了
And now I'm about to run.

368
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,900
我们要怎么收场 麦克斯
What is our end game here, Max?

369
00:16:29,060 --> 00:16:30,380
我们是要躲 还是要逃
Are we hiding? Are we fleeing?

370
00:16:30,460 --> 00:16:32,360
我就想知道我们用这么丑的姿势走向哪里
I just want to know what we're ugly-walking toward.

371
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:34,900
我看起来像是有场可收的人吗
Do I look like a person with an end game?

372
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:36,940
还有 是你让比赛提前收场
Also, ya ended the game.

373
00:16:37,820 --> 00:16:40,180
先不说愤怒的球迷 好消息是
Angry mob aside, the good news is

374
00:16:40,180 --> 00:16:42,460
我成功把传单交到布露·艾薇的保姆手里
I did manage to get that flier to Blue Ivy's people.

375
00:16:42,460 --> 00:16:45,400
坏消息是 你创造了运动史上最大的灾难
The bad news is you created the biggest disaster in sports

376
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:47,180
完全赶超魔术师约翰逊脱口秀
since Magic Johnson's talk show.

377
00:16:50,060 --> 00:16:50,880
有人来了
Someone's coming.

378
00:16:51,500 --> 00:16:52,600
你说你想要更多跟随者[粉丝]
Well, you said you wanted more followers.

379
00:16:52,660 --> 00:16:53,880
恭喜你在现实生活中做到了
Now you have them in real life!

380
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:58,460
我的老天
Oh, my God.

381
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:02,720
这就是联盟第17强的球队宽衣解带的地方啊
This is where the 17th best team in the league gets naked!

382
00:17:03,620 --> 00:17:06,340
同时也是麦克斯和卡洛琳的葬身之地
And also where it ends for ol' Max and Caroline.

383
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:08,580
干嘛啦 球员们又不是
What? It's not like the players

384
00:17:08,580 --> 00:17:10,820
比赛一结束就直奔更衣室
come right into the locker room after the game.

385
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:11,600
妈的
Oh, my God.

386
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:14,140
球员们的确比赛一结束就直奔更衣室
The players come right into the locker room after the game!

387
00:17:15,080 --> 00:17:16,520
当然我们会在这里
Of course we'd be in here.

388
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:17,640
倒霉就是咱俩的风格啊
This is so us.

389
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:19,320
你知道还有什么是咱俩的风格吗
You know what else is so us?

390
00:17:19,620 --> 00:17:21,180
我偷一件他们的球衣
Me stealing one of these jerseys.

391
00:17:22,840 --> 00:17:24,380
我们去更衣室做采访吧
Let's do the interview in the locker rooms.

392
00:17:25,120 --> 00:17:26,220
糟糕 他们要进来了
Crap! They're coming in here.

393
00:17:26,340 --> 00:17:28,280
咱们千万不能因为这事露脸 麦克斯
We can't be the face of this, Max.

394
00:17:28,320 --> 00:17:30,380
会成为布鲁克林人见人恨的店
We'll be the most hated business in Brooklyn.

395
00:17:30,460 --> 00:17:32,460
我还算上了新开的那家有
And I'm including the new breakfast restaurant

396
00:17:32,460 --> 00:17:33,800
代客泊婴儿车的早餐店
with the valet stroller parking.

397
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:40,980
这就是联盟第17强的球队
This is where the 17th best team in the league

398
00:17:40,980 --> 00:17:41,900
尿尿的地方啊
goes number one!

399
00:17:42,540 --> 00:17:43,700
瞧瞧这些小便斗
And from the looks of it,

400
00:17:43,700 --> 00:17:45,260
看来他们不止在球场上才准头差
their aim isn't good in here, either.

401
00:17:46,620 --> 00:17:47,840
那俩妞真是疯子 伙计
Those girls were crazy, man.

402
00:17:47,980 --> 00:17:48,980
她们害我们输掉比赛
They cost us the game.

403
00:17:49,220 --> 00:17:51,296
我们差点就成为联盟第16强队呢
We were almost the 16th best team in the league.

404
00:17:51,296 --> 00:17:54,160
她们是怎么进入贵宾区的
How did they get into the VIP section?

405
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,980
我对蒂姆·艾伦也抱有一样的疑问
I was wondering the same thing about Tim Allen.

406
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:59,640
伙计 帮我看看我后背这里
Yo, man, take a look at this thing on my back.

407
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:00,758
看起来像癌吗
Does it look like cancer?

408
00:18:00,758 --> 00:18:03,049
看起来不只是一颗痣
It just seemed like more than a mole, you know?

409
00:18:03,740 --> 00:18:06,140
老实说 看起来像癌前基底细胞
Actually, it looks like a precancerous basal cell.

410
00:18:06,900 --> 00:18:09,060
我们应该进厕所看 那里的灯更亮
We should get a better look in the light in the bathroom.

411
00:18:10,820 --> 00:18:12,000
这里 这里
Here! Over here.

412
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:12,800
躲进冰浴缸里
Get in the ice bathtub.

413
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:14,060
位子够两个人
It's big enough for two.

414
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,280
"够两个人[吃]"
"Big enough for two."

415
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:18,281
红辣椒餐厅也是这么说他们的椰子奶酪棒
That's what Chili's said about their new coconut mozzarella sticks,

416
00:18:18,281 --> 00:18:20,361
但真是 扯犊子
but--swing and a miss.

417
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:23,560
你居然去红辣椒餐厅不告诉我
You went to Chili's and didn't tell me?

418
00:18:23,980 --> 00:18:26,380
我怕你在普通餐厅也要求要好位子
I was afraid you'd try to get us a better table.

419
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:30,400
没错
Oh, yeah.

420
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:32,360
我绝对会去检查一下那玩意
I'd definitely get that thing checked out.

421
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:34,701
我得冰敷膝盖
Yo, I got to ice this knee.

422
00:18:49,380 --> 00:18:52,120
他们当然会把冰倒我们身上
Of course they'd pour the ice on us!

423
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:54,380
这事当然会发生在这里
And of course this would happen here,

424
00:18:54,660 --> 00:18:55,987
因为这是发生在我俩身上
'cause it's the 17th worst thing

425
00:18:55,987 --> 00:18:58,034
第17糟的事情了
that's ever happened to me!

426
00:19:04,483 --> 00:19:05,934
你们俩病了吗
Oh, you two sick?

427
00:19:05,934 --> 00:19:07,744
别靠近我 我可不能生病
Stay away from me. I can't get sick.

428
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:10,120
一旦当你78岁 只需两天时间
When you're 78, it takes about 2 days

429
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:12,920
就能从感冒流鼻涕 变到死在家喂猫
to go from sniffles to being eaten by your cat.

430
00:19:15,100 --> 00:19:16,140
我们会好的
We'll be fine...

431
00:19:16,220 --> 00:19:19,300
前提是半颗感冒药能治愈全身体温过低
if half a Tylenol can cure full-body hypothermia.

432
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:23,160
麦克斯 我觉得你还在生我的气
Max, I feel like you're still mad at me

433
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:25,300
就因为我想要好位置看球
for wanting more for us than bad seats

434
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:26,680
想要我们的生意变景气
and a struggling business.

435
00:19:26,880 --> 00:19:28,220
我当然生气
Of course I'm mad!

436
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:29,520
我好久没试过这么冷了
I haven't been this cold

437
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:31,340
上一次还是某年冬天我参加《致命捕捞》节目时
since that winter I was on "Deadliest Catch."

438
00:19:35,140 --> 00:19:38,560
我有一垃圾桶不会使用的宝宝脸
I've got a waste can of baby faces I'm not gonna use.

439
00:19:40,100 --> 00:19:40,700
是啊
Yeah.

440
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:44,100
后来我们决定不设计我们的孩子了
Turns out, we're not gonna design our baby anymore.

441
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:47,060
但你不是想让孩子有一个精致的下巴
But what about wanting it to have a delicate chin?

442
00:19:47,060 --> 00:19:48,220
以及一条大腿缝吗
And a thigh gap?

443
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:52,880
姑娘们 我醒悟到
You know, girls, I realized

444
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:55,180
我只想要一个健康快乐的宝宝
I just want to have a healthy, happy baby.

445
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:58,240
当我拉芙阿姨失去舌头后
You know, it's like my Aunt Ruffa said

446
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:10,440
她说了这么一句话
after she lost her tongue, you know...

447
00:20:10,900 --> 00:20:12,900
"米粒又是种需有 米粒误食磨呛着"
"Dou det what dou det, and dou don't det updet."

448
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:16,060
"命里有时终须有 命里无时莫强求"
"You get what you get, and you don't get upset."

449
00:20:18,560 --> 00:20:20,980
那真是一个成熟的决定
That's a really mature decision.

450
00:20:21,940 --> 00:20:23,740
那医生张口就要6万
The doctor wanted 60 grand.

451
00:20:24,560 --> 00:20:26,580
当然 那也影响了我们的决定
Yeah, that affected our decision too.

452
00:20:28,080 --> 00:20:30,200
或许最好的方式就是让事情
Well, maybe letting things happen naturally

453
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:31,140
顺其自然
is the way to go.

454
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:33,200
因为有时你一旦强求
Because sometimes when you force things,

455
00:20:33,300 --> 00:20:36,000
就让一帮身价总计1.3亿美元的球员
you put $130 million worth of basketball players

456
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,120
变成了一群伤兵败将
on the disabled list.
